# Cross-confirm twin of gameplay_fast.script: the same route with circle and cross swapped
# (0x2000 <-> 0x4000), because with EMOTIONALSENSE_CONFIRM=cross the host's cross is the
# game's confirm. Run it with --confirm cross.
# Fast route to gameplay: skips the opening (CIRCLE at 400, START at 460;
# title at ~408). Used by scripts/check_scripts.sh, which must finish in
# under a minute. The full route is scripts/gameplay.script.
400:4000:5
460:0008:5
@1+60:0008:5
@1+200:4000:5
@1+260:4000:5
@1+320:4000:5
@1+380:4000:5
